@base = http://localhost:8081

GET {{base}}/api/courses

### einzelnes Kursangebot
GET {{base}}/api/courses/1

### gültiger POST, erwartet 201 und Location-Header
POST {{base}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: create-mu-99

{"courseCode":"MU-99","title":"Songwriting","fee":80.0}

### derselbe Kurscode, erwartet 409
POST {{base}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: conflict-mu-99

{"courseCode":"MU-99","title":"Songwriting II","fee":90.0}

### leerer Kurscode, erwartet 400 mit fields.courseCode
POST {{base}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: validation-course-code

{"courseCode":"","title":"Songwriting","fee":80.0}
